# GO-2026-5932: golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained and unsafe by
# design. This finding is a module-level flag on golang.org/x/crypto itself,
# but the plugin (and its dependency chain) never imports the openpgp
# subpackage: `go mod why golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp` reports "main module
# does not need package golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp". No fix exists for this
# advisory since the openpgp package is permanently deprecated. Attack
# surface is zero because the vulnerable code path is unreachable.
GO-2026-5932
